{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"ananse-and-the-midnight-thread","version":1,"title":"Ananse and the Midnight Thread","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"One night in Accra, the lights went out. The fan stopped. The whole street went dark. Nutifafa sat up in bed. “Mama?” he whispered. Nobody answered.","sentences":["One night in Accra, the lights went out.","The fan stopped.","The whole street went dark.","Nutifafa sat up in bed.","“Mama?” he whispered.","Nobody answered."],"image":"sha256:de4ba8724abdb2fc6ea2a6d8d1bdb5ba195219c1568d5f0860f876ad728379f3","alt":"A boy in pyjamas sits up in a dark bedroom with moonlight at the window.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:8dc6b4856e1b69f7a8a1191339da366a4f438d9d21ce8e768932d1adbd247bff","durationMs":16840,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4122],[4122,6227],[6227,9122],[9122,11665],[11665,15086],[15086,16840]],"words":[[0,263],[263,702],[702,877],[877,1754],[1754,2017],[2017,2544],[2544,2894],[2894,4122],[4122,4385],[4385,4649],[4649,6227],[6227,6490],[6490,6929],[6929,7455],[7455,7806],[7806,9122],[9122,9823],[9823,10086],[10086,10262],[10262,10437],[10437,11665],[11665,13156],[13156,13332],[13332,15086],[15086,15612],[15612,16840]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"In the corner of the room stood a tall, lumpy shape with long arms. Nutifafa’s tummy went tight. “A monster,” he said. His torch clicked, but it did not work.","sentences":["In the corner of the room stood a tall, lumpy shape with long arms.","Nutifafa’s tummy went tight.","“A monster,” he said.","His torch clicked, but it did not work."],"image":"sha256:6288b0dc8b2f4a00e8846493e24dc03a6b4ee4904efa7bdd400783ecd9d26505","alt":"A boy stares at a tall shadowy shape in the corner of his room.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:5bc8721556b1375f4888f3ba2d1305afe16bb25541596addbdd68b3ca208e1d7","durationMs":15520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6050],[6050,9119],[9119,11925],[11925,15520]],"words":[[0,175],[175,438],[438,965],[965,1140],[1140,1403],[1403,1754],[1754,2192],[2192,2367],[2367,3157],[3157,3595],[3595,4033],[4033,4384],[4384,4735],[4735,6050],[6050,6927],[6927,7365],[7365,7716],[7716,9119],[9119,9294],[9294,10434],[10434,10610],[10610,11925],[11925,12188],[12188,12626],[12626,13679],[13679,13942],[13942,14117],[14117,14380],[14380,14643],[14643,15520]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Then a tiny silver light blinked on the wall. A very small voice said, “Good evening, Nutifafa. I am Ananse.” It was a spider, small as a bean, with eight little legs and a gold bead like a crown.","sentences":["Then a tiny silver light blinked on the wall.","A very small voice said, “Good evening, Nutifafa.","I am Ananse.” It was a spider, small as a bean, with eight little legs and a gold bead like a crown."],"image":"sha256:7d1ea5d8a4f38b3b3e4381b35dc5b39d20b40d3cea2d3687c793526189dd8844","alt":"A tiny glowing spider with a gold bead crown stands on the wall.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:de3cb2c8ab03c9f4d6427cca071677bad1d89163b4012b9898af99dc6a831599","durationMs":23520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5227],[5227,11869],[11869,23520]],"words":[[0,436],[436,653],[653,1089],[1089,1742],[1742,2287],[2287,3049],[3049,3267],[3267,3593],[3593,5227],[5227,5444],[5444,5880],[5880,6424],[6424,6969],[6969,7949],[7949,8493],[8493,9800],[9800,11869],[11869,12087],[12087,12304],[12304,14264],[14264,14482],[14482,14809],[14809,15027],[15027,16224],[16224,16769],[16769,16987],[16987,17204],[17204,18184],[18184,18620],[18620,19164],[19164,19818],[19818,20253],[20253,20580],[20580,20798],[20798,21233],[21233,21669],[21669,22104],[22104,22322],[22322,23520]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"“Everyone knows my stories,” said Ananse. “But tonight I have a different job. I help people be brave.” Ananse spun a silver thread across the room. It glowed softly, like a tiny road in the dark.","sentences":["“Everyone knows my stories,” said Ananse.","“But tonight I have a different job.","I help people be brave.” Ananse spun a silver thread across the room.","It glowed softly, like a tiny road in the dark."],"image":"sha256:4f15854f6d06ada93532cdc19fb8abdbda6ea07aca9c78230172b6fb3d3f507f","alt":"The spider spins a glowing silver thread across the room.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:d6b435c4c17eb0c1d4d0b7243e81c26bcc3a753e3688ec26214cc1e090a6d063","durationMs":20840,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4758],[4758,8755],[8755,16272],[16272,20840]],"words":[[0,856],[856,1332],[1332,1523],[1523,2760],[2760,3140],[3140,4758],[4758,5139],[5139,5805],[5805,5995],[5995,6376],[6376,6566],[6566,7422],[7422,8755],[8755,8945],[8945,9326],[9326,9897],[9897,10087],[10087,11705],[11705,12276],[12276,12656],[12656,12847],[12847,13418],[13418,13988],[13988,14559],[14559,14845],[14845,16272],[16272,16463],[16463,17034],[17034,18080],[18080,18461],[18461,18651],[18651,19032],[19032,19413],[19413,19603],[19603,19888],[19888,20840]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"“Hold the thread,” said Ananse, “and take one step at a time.” Nutifafa climbed out of bed. He held the glowing thread. One step. Two steps. Three steps. His feet were on the cool floor, and his heart was beating fast.","sentences":["“Hold the thread,” said Ananse, “and take one step at a time.” Nutifafa climbed out of bed.","He held the glowing thread.","One step.","Two steps.","Three steps.","His feet were on the cool floor, and his heart was beating fast."],"image":"sha256:7b6306ee6c7a4bf15060f21f1de15f3685b38c4140d9368b3660c19fb1cc9d4f","alt":"The boy holds a glowing thread and takes careful steps across the room.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:e2ce2e70f0689e408c4f1ec9ba00f54a9c26ae683f71fc3024953f054928b626","durationMs":23520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9555],[9555,12587],[12587,14241],[14241,15986],[15986,17916],[17916,23520]],"words":[[0,459],[459,735],[735,1838],[1838,2205],[2205,3216],[3216,3583],[3583,3951],[3951,4226],[4226,4594],[4594,4778],[4778,4961],[4961,6431],[6431,7166],[7166,7809],[7809,8085],[8085,8269],[8269,9555],[9555,9739],[9739,10106],[10106,10382],[10382,11025],[11025,12587],[12587,12863],[12863,14241],[14241,14516],[14516,15986],[15986,16446],[16446,17916],[17916,18191],[18191,18559],[18559,18926],[18926,19110],[19110,19386],[19386,19753],[19753,20672],[20672,20948],[20948,21223],[21223,21683],[21683,21958],[21958,22601],[22601,23520]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"“Now look closely,” said Ananse. “A good detective looks, and then looks again.” Nutifafa leaned in. The tall lumpy shape was not a monster. It was his school coat on the wardrobe door, with his bag hanging from the hook.","sentences":["“Now look closely,” said Ananse.","“A good detective looks, and then looks again.” Nutifafa leaned in.","The tall lumpy shape was not a monster.","It was his school coat on the wardrobe door, with his bag hanging from the hook."],"image":"sha256:27b57b6d54d635d234c6575a537b7f5c761d98717d87aa986e3cc9491dc7671c","alt":"The boy looks at a school coat and bag hanging on a wardrobe door.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:a6c38715d2925887a7ff7ecc6aa0b6338a80f2e4a9b5dbf95dd8f63fc57c2ee7","durationMs":21400,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3745],[3745,10967],[10967,14802],[14802,21400]],"words":[[0,357],[357,713],[713,1872],[1872,2229],[2229,3745],[3745,3923],[3923,4280],[4280,5083],[5083,5974],[5974,6242],[6242,6598],[6598,7044],[7044,8560],[8560,9273],[9273,9808],[9808,10967],[10967,11235],[11235,11592],[11592,12038],[12038,12483],[12483,12751],[12751,13018],[13018,13197],[13197,14802],[14802,14980],[14980,15248],[15248,15515],[15515,16050],[16050,16407],[16407,16585],[16585,16853],[16853,17566],[17566,18368],[18368,18725],[18725,18993],[18993,19260],[19260,19884],[19884,20241],[20241,20508],[20508,21400]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Nutifafa laughed a small laugh. “It is my coat!” “Yes,” said Ananse. “Spiders have eight eyes, and even so we look twice. Fear grows in the dark, but it shrinks when you look closely.” Outside, Mama’s candle glowed in the doorway. “Nutifafa? I am here.”","sentences":["Nutifafa laughed a small laugh.","“It is my coat!” “Yes,” said Ananse.","“Spiders have eight eyes, and even so we look twice.","Fear grows in the dark, but it shrinks when you look closely.” Outside, Mama’s candle glowed in the doorway.","“Nutifafa?","I am here.”"],"image":"sha256:4cecd6f600773299e49e165caf7033f4a9c2d10195f5c53da6b194f3d6b55c25","alt":"The boy laughs while his mother holds a candle in the doorway.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:0aa95038565b97ba48adb792f710e0607baa204ae846a4a6aaba4fc046a115d1","durationMs":26840,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3377],[3377,8176],[8176,13242],[13242,23729],[23729,25507],[25507,26840]],"words":[[0,711],[711,1333],[1333,1511],[1511,1955],[1955,3377],[3377,3644],[3644,3822],[3822,3999],[3999,5421],[5421,6310],[6310,6666],[6666,8176],[8176,8887],[8887,9243],[9243,9687],[9687,10487],[10487,10754],[10754,11109],[11109,11287],[11287,11465],[11465,11820],[11820,13242],[13242,13598],[13598,14042],[14042,14220],[14220,14486],[14486,15286],[15286,15553],[15553,15731],[15731,16353],[16353,16708],[16708,16975],[16975,17330],[17330,19019],[19019,20086],[20086,20619],[20619,21152],[21152,21685],[21685,21863],[21863,22130],[22130,23729],[23729,25507],[25507,25685],[25685,25862],[25862,26840]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Nutifafa hugged his mother. When he looked back, the spider and the thread were gone, but a tiny silver shine sat on the windowsill. The lights came back on with a hum. “Goodnight, Ananse,” whispered Nutifafa. And he slept. The end.","sentences":["Nutifafa hugged his mother.","When he looked back, the spider and the thread were gone, but a tiny silver shine sat on the windowsill.","The lights came back on with a hum.","“Goodnight, Ananse,” whispered Nutifafa.","And he slept.","The end."],"image":"sha256:cb125245d955182f1eff4d4332461b006a3b2a9a69d02932b15a6231cf22f2a9","alt":"A boy hugs his mother while a faint silver shine glows on the windowsill.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:28c3b01b1d873d71bd5ab6f9db36cea35ff0387ce432d4b13edb0bee6c1b5d64","durationMs":24520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3146],[3146,12769],[12769,16378],[16378,21467],[21467,23410],[23410,24520]],"words":[[0,740],[740,1295],[1295,1573],[1573,3146],[3146,3516],[3516,3701],[3701,4256],[4256,5089],[5089,5367],[5367,5922],[5922,6199],[6199,6477],[6477,7032],[7032,7402],[7402,8235],[8235,8513],[8513,8698],[8698,9068],[9068,9623],[9623,10086],[10086,10363],[10363,10548],[10548,10826],[10826,12769],[12769,13046],[13046,13602],[13602,13972],[13972,14342],[14342,14527],[14527,14897],[14897,15082],[15082,16378],[16378,17765],[17765,18876],[18876,19709],[19709,21467],[21467,21744],[21744,21929],[21929,23410],[23410,23687],[23687,24520]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"ananse-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":2,"question":"What did Nutifafa think the tall shape in the corner was?","options":["A monster","A tree","A teacher"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"ananse-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":6,"question":"What was the tall lumpy shape really?","options":["His school coat and bag on the wardrobe","A ghost","A big dog"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"ananse-p1","type":"prediction","afterPage":4,"prompt":"Nutifafa holds the glowing thread and takes small steps. What do you think he will find when he looks closely?","options":["Something ordinary","A real monster","A thunderstorm"]},{"id":"ananse-voc","type":"vocabulary","afterPage":3,"word":"detective","definition":"A person who looks carefully for clues to find out the truth.","distractors":["A kind of spider","A tool for sewing"]},{"id":"ananse-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["The lights went out.","Nutifafa saw a scary shape.","Ananse spun a thread.","Nutifafa looked closely and laughed."]},{"id":"ananse-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Nutifafa was scared of the dark, then felt brave. What helps you feel brave at night?","feelingOptions":["Scared","Brave","Safe","Sleepy"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"detective","definition":"A person who looks carefully for clues to find the truth.","pages":[6]},{"word":"thread","definition":"A very thin line, like string or silk.","pages":[4]},{"word":"candle","definition":"A stick of wax with a flame at the top that gives light.","pages":[7]}],"assets":{"sha256:8dc6b4856e1b69f7a8a1191339da366a4f438d9d21ce8e768932d1adbd247bff":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/8dc6b4856e1b.mp3","bytes":67820,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:5bc8721556b1375f4888f3ba2d1305afe16bb25541596addbdd68b3ca208e1d7":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/5bc8721556b1.mp3","bytes":62540,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:de3cb2c8ab03c9f4d6427cca071677bad1d89163b4012b9898af99dc6a831599":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/de3cb2c8ab03.mp3","bytes":94508,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:d6b435c4c17eb0c1d4d0b7243e81c26bcc3a753e3688ec26214cc1e090a6d063":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/d6b435c4c17e.mp3","bytes":83852,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:e2ce2e70f0689e408c4f1ec9ba00f54a9c26ae683f71fc3024953f054928b626":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/e2ce2e70f068.mp3","bytes":94508,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:a6c38715d2925887a7ff7ecc6aa0b6338a80f2e4a9b5dbf95dd8f63fc57c2ee7":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/a6c38715d292.mp3","bytes":86060,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:0aa95038565b97ba48adb792f710e0607baa204ae846a4a6aaba4fc046a115d1":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/0aa95038565b.mp3","bytes":107852,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:28c3b01b1d873d71bd5ab6f9db36cea35ff0387ce432d4b13edb0bee6c1b5d64":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/28c3b01b1d87.mp3","bytes":98540,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:de4ba8724abdb2fc6ea2a6d8d1bdb5ba195219c1568d5f0860f876ad728379f3":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/ananse-and-the-midnight-t